Z||000000||sdm1964||06-27-2000||06:00 AM||||As you may already know, we will be hosting the next RFTH 5 event. The Run <BR>will be based in Murphy, NC the weekend of September 29-30, Oct 1.<BR>The host hotel  will be the Murphy Best Western, (828)837-3060. You can <BR>start making reservations now. The rate is $58 plus tax. Remember to mention <BR>Georgia Fieros and the RFTH event when reserving. You must have your <BR>reservation made by August 15 or the rate will not be guaranteed. Ask for <BR>Natalie or for Ulkesh.<P>This is all i know for now. I will post more as i get the information.<P>||||reg||7
